{
  "version": 1,
  "_readme": "Maps game events to sounds. 'files' entries are asset ids from index.json (music/<name> or sfx/<name>); several files = random pick each time. gain 0..1, rate = playback speed, jitter = random +/- speed variation. Edit by hand or remap live in the Sound Lab (title screen) and export. Events with no files fall back to built-in synth sounds.",
